{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107270","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910727001:1":{"text":"방금, 방금 무슨 일이 일어난 거지? 재앙이 일어나는 모습이랑 육지의 풍경도 봤는데...","source_cn":"刚才、刚才发生了什么？我看到了一场灾难，还有陆地上的景象……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABF1CF7155B1CFCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910727002:1":{"text":"게다가 허공에 갑자기 나타난 빛의 장벽은 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 타라사에서 빛의 해일을 막을 때 사용했던 것과 똑같잖아!","source_cn":"那道空气中突然出现的光墙，和<style=stress...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x33F0DED0E44B7E1F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"게다가 허공에 갑자기 나타난 빛의 장벽은 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 타라사에서 빛의 해일을 막을 때 사용했던 것과 똑같잖아!","female":"게다가 허공에 갑자기 나타난 빛의 장벽은 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>(이)가 타라사에서 빛의 해일을 막을 때 사용했던 것과 똑같잖아!","variant_male_record_index":"252899","variant_female_record_index":"252900","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910727003:1":{"text":"그자가 육지인들도 이렇게 구해 준 적이 있는 건가?","source_cn":"<male>他</male><female>她</fe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF2FC7C9B81B2A2D1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그자가 육지인들도 이렇게 구해 준 적이 있는 건가?","female":"그자가 육지인들도 이렇게 구해 준 적이 있는 건가?","variant_male_record_index":"252901","variant_female_record_index":"252902","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910727004:1":{"text":"这是<male>他</male><female>她</female>的过去？我……不记得流光海发生过海啸。","source_cn":"这是<male>他</male><female>她</...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xE7DB70967361C849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910727005:1":{"text":"나, 나도 들어 본 적 없어. 할머니의 기록에도 육지 마을을 집어삼킬 정도로 거대한 파도에 관한 이야기는 없었는데.","source_cn":"我……我没听说过，连阿嬷的记录里都没有出现过能淹没陆地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3FA7E6CD90AF901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910727006:1":{"text":"정말 그런 일이 있었다면 타라사의 어른들이 아이들에게 경고하려고 동요를 만들었을 거야. 하지만 타라사에는 그런 동요가 없어.","source_cn":"如果真的发生过，塔拉萨的长辈一定会编童谣来警戒小孩子，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB562582383094A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910727007:1":{"text":"설마 훨씬 더 먼 과거의 일일까...? 아니면 과거가 아니라 미래의 일...?","source_cn":"难道是更遥远的过去吗……？或者，不是过去，是未来……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F9AECBEBE0D9D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910727008:1":{"text":"미래... 예언이라는 말인가? 그런 건 회유기도 겪어 보지 않은 애들이나 믿는 거지.","source_cn":"未来……你是说预言？那是骗幼童的，没经过洄游季的人才会信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB503E7C3371A9A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910727009:1":{"text":"我希望看到的是预言，如果是预言，灾难就不会发生……<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>用的天赋，既能在之前救塔拉萨，也能在未来救陆地人。","source_cn":"我希望看到的是预言，如果是预言，灾难就不会发生……<s...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC474B51C553F8AC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910727010:1":{"text":"如果有更多像<male>他</male><female>她</female>那样的人，你的族裔也会得救吧……","source_cn":"如果有更多像<male>他</male><female...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x552CA141B1FFB2B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910727011:1":{"text":"……我不知道。","source_cn":"……我不知道。","status":"ambiguous_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910727012:1":{"text":"난 알고 싶어!","source_cn":"我想知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1390A2E4E5A42B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910727013:1":{"text":"그러니까 더 많은 걸 알아낼 수 있다면... 그런 힘을 어떻게 얻는지, 그 힘이 어째서 재앙을 막을 수 있는지 알게 된다면, 어쩌면... 우리도 똑같이 해낼 수 있을지도 모르잖아.","source_cn":"所以，如果能知道更多——知道怎么获得那种天赋，知道它为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB54C000F2642D54E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910727014:1":{"text":"어쩌면... 다른 누군가가 구해 주기를 기다리지 않고, 우리 힘으로 스스로를 구할 수 있을지도 몰라.","source_cn":"也许……我们可以救自己，而不是等别人拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5EBF6BC8961D55F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910727015:1":{"text":"우리도 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 같은 사람이 될 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"也许，我们也能成为像<style=stress><pl...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC0CFBA4D9578EFA7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리도 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 같은 사람이 될 수 있을 거야.","female":"우리도 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 같은 사람이 될 수 있을 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"252914","variant_female_record_index":"252915","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910727016:1":{"text":"그런 힘을 재능이라고 부르는 이유가 있다... 다른 사람이 되려고 하지 마라.","source_cn":"天赋被称作天赋自有原因……别想着成为别人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF561A4A765B927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910727017:1":{"text":"하지만... 나도 남에게 구원받는 건 싫군.","source_cn":"不过……我确实讨厌被人拯救。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB34EA36E1E98FF7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910727018:1":{"text":"천해족의 딸, 저 기포들은 아직 완전하지 않다.","source_cn":"浅海裔的女儿，那些气泡还不完全……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x462E5F6535B8E56E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat